<title>FRANCE: France will not abandon health spending controls.</title>
<headline>France will not abandon health spending controls.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French government will not abandon efforts to control health spending, Employment Minister Martine Aubry said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We cannot renounce the control of health spending,&quot; she told reporters when asked about doctors' medical fees. &quot;We will continue to control health spending,&quot; she added.</p>
</text>
